# Review routing only — never architecture, standing, or authority.
#
# CODEOWNERS asks a human to look at a path. It does not define what a Node is,
# create a root seat, grant a capability, admit a peer, or settle a crossing.
# Semantic ownership lives in the governing contracts and decisions; domain
# accountability is projected separately through contracts/domain-owners.json.
#
# STATUS.yaml standing, decisions/, and the governing document set carry judgement-
# typed claims. No check, label, bot, or green build reaches RATIFIED; owner review on
# these paths is how ratification can be presented to the owner when branch protection
# requires it. See decisions/0016-github-coordination-registrar.md.

